<%- include("partials/header.ejs") %>
    <h1>About BlogIt</h1>

    <section id="about-section">
        <div class="about-section">
            <div class="container about-container my-5 ">
                <div class="p-5 text-center rounded-3">
                    <p class="col-lg-8 mx-auto fs-5">
                        Welcome to <strong>BlogIt</strong> — a little corner of the internet for thoughts that were
                        apparently too interesting to stay inside someone’s head.
                        <br>  <br>
                        Here, people write about pretty much everything: travel, money, programming, psychology, pets,
                        personal growth, food, life, and the occasional topic that somehow began with <i>“I was just
                        thinking…”</i> and turned into 1,500 words.
                        <br> <br>
                        BlogIt is built around a simple idea: <strong>everyone has something worth sharing</strong>. You don’t need
                        to be a professional writer, a certified expert, or someone who drinks coffee while staring
                        thoughtfully out of a rainy window. You just need an idea, an experience, a story, or something
                        you’ve learned that might make another person think, laugh, discover something new, or say,
                         <i> “Wait... I’ve wondered about that too.”</i>
                        <br> <br>
                        You can explore posts, discover writers, leave comments, save your favorites for later, and
                        maybe even publish something of your own.
                        <br> <br>
                        No pressure to sound profound. No requirement to change the world with every paragraph.
                        <br> <br>
                        Sometimes a good blog post is simply:
                        <br> <br>
                        <i>“I learned a thing. Here’s the thing.”</i>

                        And frankly, we’re big fans of that.

                    </p>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>